{"title":"Career Roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyzes, visualizes, and interprets data to help organizations make better decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Computer Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyzes, visualizes, and interprets data to help organizations make better decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data collection and cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"SQL querying"},{"text":"Dashboard development"},{"text":"KPI tracking"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Business reporting"},{"text":"Trend identification"},{"text":"Customer and product analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Computer Science student, the strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Computer Science","SQL + Excel + Python + BI","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Specialist/Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"The degree provides a strong technical foundation, while statistics, databases, programming and business understanding determine employability."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc CS + SQL + Excel + Python + Power BI + statistics + projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Data Analyst / BI Analyst / Product Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Data Analyst / Analytics Specialist / Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Analytics Manager / Data & BI Architect"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Computer & Data Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"